{"id":"ee928cb8-bdd8-4a1e-885c-d3fbc07ad99b","object":"chat.completion","created":1790519770,"model":"deepseek-flash","choices":[{"index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"{"verdict":"NOT_SUBTRACTABLE","missing_or_unsupported":"No verified claim establishes the required half-year duration of the pain history; the claims only describe general symptom progression over months to years."}","reasoning_content":"We need answer only JSON. Need decide if candidate condition "a half-year history of pain in different parts of their body" in full Parent context removable. Need use verified claims. Parent: first case reported in a country that was largest country of its dominant religion in world at establishment. In this case, individual presented with half-year history of pain in different parts of body, and pain gradually worsened, causing difficulty walking and moving shoulders.

