Need output JSON only. missing_or_unsupported briefly state most important missing/unsupported semantic requirement. Could say "No verified claim establishes that the pain history lasted half a year (or that the individual presented with that duration); claims only describe general symptom progression over months to years." Ensure JSON valid."},"logprobs":null,"finish_reason":"stop"}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":863,"completion_tokens":545,"total_tokens":1408,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":256},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":501},"prompt_cache_hit_tokens":256,"prompt_cache_miss_tokens":607},"system_fingerprint":"aeb56401ca74e127821c4f9126dcb669"}
